      speakerID: Gracz
      speakerMod: 
      changeLocationId: 
    - subLines:
      - timeForSingleCharDisplay: 0
        subline: "To jaki\u015B \u017Cart!"
      lingering: -1
      speakerID: Mz
      speakerMod: D3
      changeLocationId: 
    - subLines:
      - timeForSingleCharDisplay: 0
        subline: "O jak dobrze, ju\u017C my\u015Bla\u0142em, \u017Ce to ja jestem
          morderc\u0105."
      lingering: -1
      speakerID: R
      speakerMod: C3
      changeLocationId: 
    - subLines:
      - timeForSingleCharDisplay: 0
        subline: "Mateusz, je\u017Celi jeste\u015B niewinny, nie przejmuj si\u0119.
          Spr\xF3buj\u0119 odkry\u0107 dok\u0142adnie kto zabi\u0142."
